From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sanjay Ravindran <mail2snjyrvndrn@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:10:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommax: mr7500: add AQR114C FW watchdog reload and LED blink stretch

Add kernel patch 0986-net-phy-aquantia-fw-watchdog-and-led-stretch.patch to:
- Fix inverted VEND1_GLOBAL_LED_PROV_ACT_STRETCH GENMASK(1, 0), enable
  100 ms blink stretch on TX/RX activity, and cache/restore PHY LED
  hardware-control rules via aqr_phy_led_restore().
- Monitor VEND1_GLOBAL_FW_ID (30:0x0020) and VEND1_GLOBAL_RSVD_STAT2
  heartbeat (30:0xc886) and offload aqr_firmware_reload() to
  system_unbound_wq (aqr107_fw_reload_work) with cond_resched(),
  suspend/remove cancellation, exponential backoff (30s..300s), and
  consecutive failure cap (AQR_FW_RELOAD_MAX_FAILS=5).

---
